Healthcare information is not used for advertising or unrelated marketing purposes.

Access to healthcare information is controlled according to account roles, patient assignments, and configured permissions.

Because ProCare handles health-related information, its data practices should also be accurately reflected in the Google Play Health Apps declaration and Data Safety section. Google Play currently requires health apps to complete the Health Apps declaration and requires privacy disclosures covering sensitive health information. (Google Help)

